This package is a port of the MFCAD++ dataset generator
(https://gitlab.com/CAPP-SRC/mfcad2-dataset, commit c171b76bb6f7e2537fcfafe6324b64a07d5e98db;
mirror https://github.com/josephkwok986/mfcad2) from pythonocc-core + numba to OCP + numpy.
The original work is by Andrew Colligan (CAPP-SRC), described in:

    A. R. Colligan, T. T. Robinson, D. C. Nolan, Y. Hua, W. Cao, "Hierarchical CADNet: Learning
    from B-Reps for Machining Feature Recognition", Computer-Aided Design 147 (2022) 103226.

Changes from the original are listed in the package docstring (__init__.py). The original
licence follows and applies to this port.

